<description>&lt;p&gt;RSF forces have stepped up drone attacks, striking a United Nations building and residential areas in Khartoum and killing four people, while a separate drone strike in Blue Nile state killed 19 civilians and displaced thousands near Ed Damazin. RSF-aligned troops assaulted aid offices in Nyala and a shelter in West Kordofan, causing civilian casualties. A RSF counterintelligence chief and a commander defected to the Sudanese army in Khartoum, indicating shifting loyalties. The conflict produced 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/26/lana-nusseibeh-uae-sudan-un-secretary-general&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWEFVX3lxTE5yQ0szY3JZTDN6WVlxckxwdHczb1FHbGF6b3JfYmJwQVJFV1NEZHFMbkNPRU9XSmRDSnRLZi1ZbmlmU2R0amhPelJxY3JRR0xJTHRWaUNZTDQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxQb0NESnpHdm9EdW5UdlNyTGFQZkExMFdHYklPSWFXOFdjeTlaeFJFT2tpTTd0eFl1NWNOSFJGdUJtNk1qQ0NVd0JabVhKNHZUaDlsbHJlTlJOUTRnajQtbFFKaVBxT2FMZEJRUllWNGVZZTVRZ1BTSUpnTGpTdWVySVc4cVN4Vm44WW9yNWpKOFRLNEc3dVVSdkhoVzB0eGNZdWZxSHhLcw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Yeni Safak English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUEFVX3lxTFBDdEZnWlVQYkhMVlFQdjR6cG0wQllGVHRGbUZ2b245cEdxZUJhRXdOcGNBZTdRblUtRkxOSHl3VEZSMWd4TFZRVmlpNS00OGI5?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sudan Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUEFVX3lxTE1Ha3RfbElfbFVZRHlOTWxheWhKY2ZyN2VUQVpRcEdwY2diakZ1ejBBemplZTkxNWV3VWhDdG1UMDI5WG5Ib3BYRDFZRGxRR25F?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sudan Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com